      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The sales person came to our home to speak with us - many others won't even do that!  He was very helpful and provided lots of very useful information.  The installers (who were Solar Depot employees) were fabulous!  Very polite and helpful guys.  They did a great job.  We are very happy with the system, and particularly love the information we receive wirelessly on our devices (laptops, phones, etc) about the health and performance of the system.  As mentioned by another reviewer, SA Power Networks were quite appalling.  Our solar didn't perform as intended for the first month because of quality of supply issues.  It took a month of numerous phone calls with SA Power Networks and constant checks and tests on the local supply hardware by SA Power Networks, before the problem was resolved to our satisfaction -- Solar Depot were helpful and supportive throughout this procedure.  However, our system is now working wonderfully well.  We recommend Solar Depot.",
