      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We were disappointed that there has been no follow-up contact, just to check that everything was OK. There have been no problems and we are happy with the overall installation. There seemed some reluctance to install a 4kw system, they considered 3kw was sufficient. I visited their office in Bellingen and  negotiated the 1kw increase. They were due to install a digital meter, but left the original meter, which goes into reverse. We estimate our daily usage of 18kw-20kw per day and we are making an average surplus of 6kw. The inverter confirms this as it shows us making 22kw-24kw per day. A 3kw system would have only shown a break even and perhaps not even that over time as we have had extremely good \"generating\" weather throughout the period since installation. Finally, thank you for your assistance.Kind RegardsGarry",
